      <section class="py-5 border-bottom-new-design">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 class="text-center mb-5">Quorum Blockchain - The Advantages</h2>
          <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-3 g-4">
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Privacy</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Quorum Blockchain allows us to create private transactions and
                    private contracts through public/private separation. Constellation is a P2P encrypted messaging
                    exchange that allows private data to be shared with network participants.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Alternative Consensus Mechanisms</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">We offer several consensus protocols on Quorum instead of POS or
                    POW. Raft-based Consensus model to speed up block times and transaction finality. On-demand block
                    creation Istanbul BFT consensus algorithm.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Peer Permissioning</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Peer permissioning is used with smart contracts to ensure that
                    only authorized parties can join blockchain networks. The peer to peer layer is modified to allow
                    connections from & to permissioned/authorized nodes.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

