                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Quorum, a permissioned blockchain platform built on Ethereum and designed specifically for the
                  financial industry, is a blockchain platform that is primarily focused on enterprises. Quorum
                  Blockchain was designed to share and replicate data that is common for financial enterprises.
                </div>
